{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":4416015,"known_for_department":"Visual Effects","name":"Jolanta Dudzińska","original_name":"Jolanta Dudzińska","popularity":0.0925,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jLdS7fayBLc2Q059wJxW2FkgCFU.jpg","id":234928,"title":"Gwiazda Kopernika","original_title":"Gwiazda Kopernika","overview":"Nicolaus Copernicus, the son of a Toruń merchant, is a bright and curious child. When he is ten years old, the Dutch astrologer Paul van de Volder predicts a great future for him, which develops in the boy an interest in the stars. Paul van de Volder reappears in Nikolai's life when he is already a student at the Jagiellonian University in Krakow. A battle for the student's soul begins between the charlatan astrologer and Wojciech of Brudzew and other university professors. Astrology fights with astronomy. From the doubts and questions that hound Nicholas, a discovery is born that will change the world.","poster_path":"/ro5F35hV46Sx5Gx01MsmvTvMDGz.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[16,10751,36],"popularity":0.6102,"release_date":"2009-09-08","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":3.0,"vote_count":1}]}],"total_pages":1,"total_results":1}